However, even in its SC realization,

$ cat catalogue/bpf/tests/amo-sequence-2.litmus
BPF amo-sequence-2
(*
 * Result: Never *) {
 0:r2=x; 0:r4=y;
 1:r2=y;
 2:r2=y; 2:r4=x;
}
